{"id":4882,"date":"2024-05-10T03:29:10","date_gmt":"2024-05-10T03:29:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/?p=4882"},"modified":"2024-05-10T04:06:07","modified_gmt":"2024-05-10T04:06:07","slug":"10-bai-hat-ngay-quoc-te-thieu-nhi-1-6-hay-nhat","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/10-bai-hat-ngay-quoc-te-thieu-nhi-1-6-hay-nhat\/","title":{"rendered":"10+ B\u00e0i H\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1\/6 Hay Nh\u1ea5t."},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi 1\/6 l\u00e0 d\u1ecbp \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u00fang ta t\u00f4n vinh nh\u1eefng n\u1ee5 c\u01b0\u1eddi trong s\u00e1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ng\u00e2y th\u01a1 c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb th\u01a1. Nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang l\u1ea1i ni\u1ec1m vui, s\u1ef1 ph\u1ea5n kh\u00edch cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf m\u00e0 c\u00f2n gi\u00fap truy\u1ec1n t\u1ea3i nh\u1eefng th\u00f4ng \u0111i\u1ec7p \u00fd ngh\u0129a v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh b\u1ea1n, \u01b0\u1edbc m\u01a1 v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng. <a href=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/\">Angeline.vn<\/a> xin gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u danh s\u00e1ch 10+ b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi hay nh\u1ea5t, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch qua nhi\u1ec1u th\u1ebf h\u1ec7, \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 gia \u0111\u00ecnh c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 c\u00f9ng h\u00e1t v\u00e0 chia s\u1ebb ni\u1ec1m vui v\u1edbi tr\u1ebb em.<\/p>\n<h2>1. Em L\u00e0 Hoa H\u1ed3ng Nh\u1ecf<\/h2>\n<p>B\u00e0i h\u00e1t Em L\u00e0 Hoa H\u1ed3ng Nh\u1ecf l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch nh\u1ea5t t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam. Ca kh\u00fac n\u00e0y v\u1edbi giai \u0111i\u1ec7u nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, l\u1eddi b\u00e0i h\u00e1t \u0111\u1ea7y \u1eafp t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m, ca ng\u1ee3i v\u1ebb \u0111\u1eb9p tinh kh\u00f4i v\u00e0 trong s\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb th\u01a1, nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng b\u00f4ng hoa nh\u1ecf \u0111ang d\u1ea7n kh\u1ebd n\u1edf r\u1ed9.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4891\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4891\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4891\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho.jpg\" alt=\"Em L\u00e0 Hoa H\u1ed3ng Nh\u1ecf\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Em-La-Hoa-Hong-Nho-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4891\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Em L\u00e0 Hoa H\u1ed3ng Nh\u1ecf<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>2. X\u00fac X\u1eafc X\u00fac X\u1ebb<\/h2>\n<p>B\u00e0i h\u00e1t X\u00fac X\u1eafc X\u00fac X\u1ebb l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng v\u1edbi giai \u0111i\u1ec7u vui nh\u1ed9n, gi\u00fap tr\u1ebb em h\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ebfm v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn bi\u1ebft c\u00e1c con s\u1ed1 qua tr\u00f2 ch\u01a1i d\u00e2n gian. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong c\u00e1c tr\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea7m non v\u00e0 ti\u1ec3u h\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c s\u1edbm cho tr\u1ebb.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4895\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4895\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4895\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe.jpg\" alt=\"X\u00fac X\u1eafc X\u00fac X\u1ebb\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Xuc-Xac-Xuc-Xe-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4895\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">X\u00fac X\u1eafc X\u00fac X\u1ebb<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>3. B\u1ed1ng B\u1ed1ng Bang Bang<\/h2>\n<p>B\u1ed1ng B\u1ed1ng Bang Bang l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi vui nh\u1ed9n, s\u00f4i \u0111\u1ed9ng, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u tr\u1ebb em y\u00eau th\u00edch. Ca kh\u00fac n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 mang \u0111\u1ebfn ti\u1ebfng c\u01b0\u1eddi m\u00e0 c\u00f2n gi\u00fap c\u00e1c em ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u1ef9 n\u0103ng v\u1eadn \u0111\u1ed9ng th\u00f4ng qua c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u00e1c nh\u1ea3y \u0111i\u1ec7u ngh\u1ec7.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4887\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4887\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4887\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang.jpg\" alt=\"B\u1ed1ng B\u1ed1ng Bang Bang\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Bong-Bong-Bang-Bang-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4887\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u1ed1ng B\u1ed1ng Bang Bang<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>4. M\u00e1i Tr\u01b0\u1eddng M\u1ebfn Y\u00eau<\/h2>\n<p>M\u00e1i Tr\u01b0\u1eddng M\u1ebfn Y\u00eau l\u00e0 b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi ca ng\u1ee3i t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u00e0 c\u00e1c em c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecdc v\u00e0 th\u1ea7y c\u00f4. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t nh\u1ea5n m\u1ea1nh t\u1ea7m quan tr\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c h\u1ecdc t\u1eadp v\u00e0 tri \u00e2n \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 d\u00ecu d\u1eaft c\u00e1c em tr\u00ean con \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng tri th\u1ee9c.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4893\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4893\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4893\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu.jpg\" alt=\"M\u00e1i Tr\u01b0\u1eddng M\u1ebfn Y\u00eau\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Mai-Truong-Men-Yeu-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4893\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u00e1i Tr\u01b0\u1eddng M\u1ebfn Y\u00eau<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>5. Kh\u00fac H\u00e1t Chim S\u01a1n Ca<\/h2>\n<p>Kh\u00fac H\u00e1t Chim S\u01a1n Ca l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng, thanh tho\u00e1t, l\u1ea5y c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng t\u1eeb ti\u1ebfng h\u00f3t c\u1ee7a chim s\u01a1n ca. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch tr\u1ebb em y\u00eau qu\u00fd v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 thi\u00ean nhi\u00ean, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u00fap c\u00e1c em th\u01b0 gi\u00e3n v\u00e0 t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y ni\u1ec1m vui trong \u00e2m nh\u1ea1c.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4892\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4892\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4892\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca.jpg\" alt=\"Kh\u00fac H\u00e1t Chim S\u01a1n Ca\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Khuc-Hat-Chim-Son-Ca-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4892\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Kh\u00fac H\u00e1t Chim S\u01a1n Ca<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>6. C\u1ea3 Nh\u00e0 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng Nhau<\/h2>\n<p>C\u1ea3 Nh\u00e0 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng Nhau l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi \u1ea5m \u00e1p, n\u00f3i v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m gia \u0111\u00ecnh v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m m\u00e0 c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean trong gia \u0111\u00ecnh d\u00e0nh cho nhau. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c gia \u0111\u00ecnh c\u00f9ng h\u00e1t trong c\u00e1c d\u1ecbp l\u1ec5 h\u1ed9i v\u00e0 ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m gia \u0111\u00ecnh.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4888\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4888\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4888\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau.jpg\" alt=\"C\u1ea3 Nh\u00e0 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng Nhau\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ca-Nha-Thuong-Nhau-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4888\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u1ea3 Nh\u00e0 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng Nhau<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>7. Ng\u00e0y \u0110\u1ea7u Ti\u00ean \u0110i H\u1ecdc<\/h2>\n<p>Ng\u00e0y \u0110\u1ea7u Ti\u00ean \u0110i H\u1ecdc l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi r\u1ea5t \u00fd ngh\u0129a, k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 c\u1ea3m x\u00fac h\u1ed3i h\u1ed9p, vui s\u01b0\u1edbng c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c em khi b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u m\u1ed9t ch\u1eb7ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1edbi. Ca kh\u00fac n\u00e0y gi\u00fap c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb t\u00e2m l\u00fd t\u1ed1t cho nh\u1eefng ng\u00e0y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean t\u1edbi tr\u01b0\u1eddng, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi nh\u1eafc nh\u1edf c\u00e1c em v\u1ec1 t\u1ea7m quan tr\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4894\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4894\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4894\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc.jpg\" alt=\"Ng\u00e0y \u0110\u1ea7u Ti\u00ean \u0110i H\u1ecdc\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ngay-Dau-Tien-Di-Hoc-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4894\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ng\u00e0y \u0110\u1ea7u Ti\u00ean \u0110i H\u1ecdc<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size: 23.04px; color: #333333;\">8. <\/span>\u0110\u01b0a C\u01a1m Cho M\u1eb9 \u0110i C\u00e0y<\/h2>\n<p>\u0110\u01b0a C\u01a1m Cho M\u1eb9 \u0110i C\u00e0y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi v\u00f4 c\u00f9ng c\u1ea3m \u0111\u1ed9ng, ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n Vi\u1ec7t Nam qua g\u00f3c nh\u00ecn c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb em. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 tr\u00e2n tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 tr\u1ebb em d\u00e0nh cho c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c c\u1ee7a cha m\u1eb9. Ca kh\u00fac n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c tr\u1ebb v\u1ec1 t\u00ecnh y\u00eau gia \u0111\u00ecnh m\u00e0 c\u00f2n gieo r\u1eafc nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u1ec1 s\u1ef1 ch\u0103m ch\u1ec9 v\u00e0 khi\u00eam t\u1ed1n.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4890\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4890\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4890\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay.jpg\" alt=\"\u0110\u01b0a C\u01a1m Cho M\u1eb9 \u0110i C\u00e0y\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Dua-Com-Cho-Me-Di-Cay-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4890\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u01b0a C\u01a1m Cho M\u1eb9 \u0110i C\u00e0y<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>9. Ai Y\u00eau B\u00e1c H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh H\u01a1n Thi\u1ebfu Ni\u00ean Nhi \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/h2>\n<p>Ai Y\u00eau B\u00e1c H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh H\u01a1n Thi\u1ebfu Ni\u00ean Nhi \u0110\u1ed3ng l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c y\u00eau th\u00edch nh\u1ea5t \u1edf Vi\u1ec7t Nam, th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n l\u00f2ng y\u00eau m\u1ebfn s\u00e2u s\u1eafc \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi B\u00e1c H\u1ed3 k\u00ednh y\u00eau. B\u00e0i h\u00e1t vang l\u00ean t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m c\u1ee7a th\u1ebf h\u1ec7 tr\u1ebb \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi v\u1ecb l\u00e3nh t\u1ee5 k\u00ednh y\u00eau, qua \u0111\u00f3 truy\u1ec1n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng v\u00e0 nu\u00f4i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng l\u00f2ng t\u1ef1 h\u00e0o d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c trong m\u1ed7i tr\u1ebb em Vi\u1ec7t Nam.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4886\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4886\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4886\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong.jpg\" alt=\"Ai Y\u00eau B\u00e1c H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh H\u01a1n Thi\u1ebfu Ni\u00ean Nhi \u0110\u1ed3ng\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Ai-Yeu-Bac-Ho-Chi-Minh-Hon-Thieu-Nien-Nhi-Dong-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4886\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ai Y\u00eau B\u00e1c H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh H\u01a1n Thi\u1ebfu Ni\u00ean Nhi \u0110\u1ed3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<h2>10. \u0110i H\u1ecdc<\/h2>\n<p>B\u00e0i h\u00e1t \u0110i H\u1ecdc l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t b\u00e0i h\u00e1t Ng\u00e0y Qu\u1ed1c T\u1ebf Thi\u1ebfu Nhi r\u1ea5t quen thu\u1ed9c v\u1edbi c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf Vi\u1ec7t Nam, mang giai \u0111i\u1ec7u vui t\u01b0\u01a1i, trong tr\u1ebbo, ca ng\u1ee3i ni\u1ec1m h\u00e2n hoan khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ebfn tr\u01b0\u1eddng. Ca kh\u00fac n\u00e0y khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch tinh th\u1ea7n ham h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi, kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 c\u1ee7a tr\u1ebb th\u01a1, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi kh\u01a1i g\u1ee3i ni\u1ec1m vui khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eb7p g\u1ee1 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 v\u00e0 th\u1ea7y c\u00f4 t\u1ea1i tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ecdc.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4889\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4889\" style=\"width: 1645px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4889\" src=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc.jpg\" alt=\"\u0110i H\u1ecdc\" width=\"1645\" height=\"1050\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc.jpg 1645w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc-627x400.jpg 627w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc-1253x800.jpg 1253w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc-768x490.jpg 768w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc-1536x980.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/angeline.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/Di-Hoc-600x383.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1645px) 100vw, 1645px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4889\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110i H\u1ecdc<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ti\u1ec7n gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed trong ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 truy\u1ec1n \u0111\u1ea1t c\u00e1c gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u0103n h\u00f3a, \u0111\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ee9c v\u00e0 t\u00ecnh c\u1ea3m gia \u0111\u00ecnh. Ch\u00fang gi\u00fap nu\u00f4i d\u01b0\u1ee1ng t\u00e2m h\u1ed3n tr\u1ebb th\u01a1, l\u00e0m gi\u00e0u th\u00eam t\u00ecnh y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 k\u00ednh tr\u1ecdng m\u00e0 tr\u1ebb em c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00e0nh cho gia \u0111\u00ecnh, th\u1ea7y c\u00f4 v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xung quanh. \u0110\u1ec3 ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ng\u00e0y h\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfng c\u01b0\u1eddi, h\u00e3y c\u00f9ng nhau h\u00e1t vang nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y, \u0111em l\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng kh\u00ed \u1ea5m \u00e1p v\u00e0 y\u00eau th\u01b0\u01a1ng cho m\u1ecdi nh\u00e0.<\/p>\n<p>Danh s\u00e1ch c\u00e1c b\u00e0i h\u00e1t n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t trong ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00e1c b\u1eadc ph\u1ee5 huynh v\u00e0 gi\u00e1o vi\u00ean gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c, gi\u1ea3i tr\u00ed cho tr\u1ebb em. H\u00e3y c\u00f9ng ch\u1ecdn l\u1ef1a nh\u1eefng b\u00e0i h\u00e1t y\u00eau th\u00edch v\u00e0 t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c m\u1ed9t ng\u00e0y l\u1ec5 th\u1eadt \u00fd ngh\u0129a cho c\u00e1c em nh\u1ecf, \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u00e0y T\u1ebft Thi\u1ebfu Nhi th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh ng\u00e0y h\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a ni\u1ec1m vui v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfng c\u01b0\u1eddi.<\/p>\n<p>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<\/p>\n<p>\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc06\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc04 \u2013 \ud835\udc04\ud835\udc15\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc13 \ud835\udc0f\ud835\udc0b\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc0d\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11<br \/>\n<em>Mang ni\u1ec1m vui \u0111\u1ebfn thi\u00ean th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n<\/em><br \/>\n\u2022 Address:\u00a0<strong>20 Ng\u00f5 176 L\u00ea Tr\u1ecdng T\u1ea5n, Thanh Xu\u00e2n, H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2022 Hotline:\u00a0<strong>0986897655 \u2013 0976830880<\/strong><br \/>\n\u2022 Fanpage:\u00